        "name": "[小猫回家记][业务-主线] [条件] 30 分钟战斗结算 < 1",
        "type": "query alert",
        "query": "sum(last_30m):sum:kitty.battle.settle{service:kitty-api,env:preview,!qa:true}.as_count() < 1",
        "message": "复合告警的条件子监控；无通知接收人，仅供组合状态求值。",
